{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/035-gu-feng/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0005-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/035-gu-feng/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0005-1/data.json","title":"詩經注析 · 就其深矣，方之舟之。就其浅矣，泳之游之。何有何亡，黾勉求之。凡民有丧，匍匐救之。 · 程俊英、蒋见元 · 章解","description":"風 · 邶風 · 谷風 · 《詩經注析》关于“就其深矣，方之舟之。就其浅矣，泳之游之。何有何亡…”的注脚：方，筏子。郑笺：“方，泭（桴的假借字）也。”毛传：“舟，船也。”都是以当时语注古语。按：方、舟二字这里都作动词“渡水”用。泳、游，朱熹诗集传：“…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"035-gu-feng","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","glossId":"0005-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/035-gu-feng/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0005-1","poem":{"id":"035-gu-feng","title":"谷風","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"beifeng","path":["風","邶風","谷風"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"习习谷风","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"以阴以雨","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"黾勉同心","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"不宜有怒","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"采葑采菲","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"无以下体","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"德音莫违","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"及尔同死","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"行道迟迟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"中心有违","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"不远伊迩","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"薄送我畿","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"谁谓荼苦","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"其甘如荠","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"宴尔新昏","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-016","text":"如兄如弟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-017","text":"泾以渭浊","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-018","text":"湜湜其沚","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-019","text":"宴尔新昏","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-020","text":"不我屑以","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-021","text":"毋逝我梁","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-022","text":"毋发我笱","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-023","text":"我躬不阅","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-024","text":"遑恤我后","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-025","text":"就其深矣","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-026","text":"方之舟之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-027","text":"就其浅矣","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-028","text":"泳之游之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-029","text":"何有何亡","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-030","text":"黾勉求之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-031","text":"凡民有丧","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-032","text":"匍匐救之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-033","text":"不我能慉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-034","text":"反以我为雠","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-035","text":"既阻我德","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-036","text":"贾用不售","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-037","text":"昔育恐育鞫","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-038","text":"及尔颠覆","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-039","text":"既生既育","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-040","text":"比予于毒","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-041","text":"我有旨蓄","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-042","text":"亦以御冬","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-043","text":"宴尔新昏","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-044","text":"以我御穷","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-045","text":"有洸有溃","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-046","text":"既诒我肄","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-047","text":"不念昔者","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-048","text":"伊余来塈","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","title":"詩經注析","authors":["程俊英","蔣見元"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","era":"现代","publicationYear":1991,"carrier":"PDF"},"annotation":{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":7,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"就其深矣，方之舟之。就其浅矣，泳之游之。何有何亡，黾勉求之。凡民有丧，匍匐救之。","targetNotes":"第四章。","sourceLabel":"第 73-74 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 73-74 四章注析。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"章解","text":"方，筏子。郑笺：“方，泭（桴的假借字）也。”毛传：“舟，船也。”都是以当时语注古语。按：方、舟二字这里都作动词“渡水”用。泳、游，朱熹诗集传：“潜行曰泳，浮水曰游。”此章前四句是起兴，以渡水比喻治理家务。孔疏：“随水深浅，期于必渡，以兴己于君子之家事，随事难易，期于必成。”后人据此，推想诗人可能是一位渔妇。亡，同无。毛传：“有，谓富也。亡，谓贫也。”何有何亡，黾勉求之，郑笺：“君子何所有乎？何所亡乎？吾其黾勉勤力为求之，有求多，亡求有。”民，人，指邻人。丧，读平声，指凶祸的事。朱熹诗集传：“又周睦其邻里乡党，莫不尽其道也。”匍匐，一作扶服，本义是手足伏地爬行。说文：“匍，手行也。匐，伏地也。”这里用来形容竭尽全力。这章叙述过去在治家睦邻方面都尽了力，无被弃之理。韵读：阳部一一方、泳（音养）、亡、丧。幽部一一舟、游、求、救。","notes":null}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"篇序","title":"题解","href":"/sh